这个先锋官，孤王就先预定下了！"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,32,0,20,50,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,43,0,26,50,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,111,0,30,54,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,112,0,30,46,3]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[204,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":1004,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":1006,"title":"攻山","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["攻山"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[47]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,54,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[23,54,36,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[22,60,48,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,48,48,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,42,66,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[4,42,60,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[15,42,72,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,68,60,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[31,68,66,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[30,68,72,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[8,54,64,0,6]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["史录·事件"]},"end":16},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,4095,2,0,1]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["22仁寿四年六月，「英雄会」攻克金堤关。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["地城遗踪"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["金堤关  帅帐"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&秦琼\n多谢各位兄弟相救！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[8,6,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[8,6,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[8,0,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏征\n叔宝脱出潼关后，人不离鞍，\n奋战取金堤，是为大功一件，\n应当是兄弟们谢你才对呀！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&管毅\n是呀，秦二哥辛苦了。众兄弟\n也都是一路从山东赶来，衣不\n离甲攻打金堤关，俱已人困马乏。\n&管毅\n如今总算有了落脚之地，本应排筵\n庆功。只是金堤虽固，却缺少粮草\n补给，难保长久。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,54,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&管毅\n兵贵神速，\n请大哥立即下令攻打瓦岗山！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏征\n……我军如此疲惫，急需\n休整。管兄弟所说攻山之事，\n是否可以缓上一日？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,6,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐茂功\n呵呵，管兄弟说得极对，\n攻山之事一日都缓不得。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐茂功\n瓦岗寨的叛将董平与金堤关的花家兄弟\n僵持多日，寨中人心惶惶。如今我们休\n整，寨中的叛军也将得到休整。\n&徐茂功\n瓦岗寨钱粮充裕，叛军没有后顾之忧，\n而我军却要担心官军卷土重来。所以\n必须速战速决，改变不利于我的局势。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[4,3,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[31,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[30,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&单雄信\n三哥和管兄弟说得有道理。\n大哥，下令打吧！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[4,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏征\n好……\n大家各自清点人马，准备出发！"]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[45]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[4,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[31,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[30,0,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,60,54,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,22,0,68,48,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,8,0,54,56,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,22,0,68,54,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_mo